1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,656
Assalamu alaikum!

2
00:00:01,656 --> 00:00:06,383
Would you like to make Gemini a better Islamic companion to you?

3
00:00:06,383 --> 00:00:19,160
Here's a simple setting change you can make to help it do exactly that — backed by real research from iaser.ai, an organization dedicated to making sure AI benefits Muslims.

4
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:28,100
In your browser, go to s.iaser.ai/prompt.

5
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:33,040
Scroll to the Gemini section, and copy Part 1.

6
00:00:33,290 --> 00:00:41,610
Now open Gemini. In Settings, choose Personal Intelligence — that takes you to Your instructions for Gemini.

7
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:46,460
Click Add... paste Part 1... and Submit.

8
00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:51,140
Back on the page, copy Part 2.

9
00:00:52,260 --> 00:00:56,940
Then Add again... paste Part 2... and Submit.

10
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:09,000
Done — Gemini takes the prompt in two short parts; the article explains why.

11
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:19,200
To read the research, and get versions for ChatGPT and Claude, visit s.iaser.ai/prompt.

